{"seq":3,"slug":"mobile-app-development","title":"移动应用开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/mobile-app-development","wordCount":941,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"移动应用开发\">移动应用开发</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>移动应用是软件产品触达用户的最直接渠道。2026 年的移动开发格局正在被华为鸿蒙 HarmonyOS NEXT 重塑——ArkTS 成为鸿蒙原生开发的核心语言，与此同时 React Native、微信小程序等跨平台方案依然在各自场景中发挥价值。高职软件技术专业的移动开发课程以鸿蒙 ArkTS 为主线，兼顾跨平台方案的认知与选型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"鸿蒙-arkts-开发\">鸿蒙 ArkTS 开发</h3><p>ArkTS 是基于 TypeScript 的声明式 UI 开发语言，配合 ArkUI 框架构建鸿蒙应用。其核心理念是&quot;一次开发、多端部署&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 鸿蒙 ArkTS 声明式 UI 示例&#10;@Entry&#10;@Component&#10;struct TodoApp {&#10;  @State todos: Array&lt;TodoItem&gt; = []&#10;  @State inputText: string = &#39;&#39;&#10;&#10;  build() {&#10;    Column() {&#10;      // 输入区域&#10;      Row() {&#10;        TextInput({ placeholder: &#39;输入待办事项...&#39; })&#10;          .onChange((value: string) =&gt; { this.inputText = value })&#10;          .layoutWeight(1)&#10;&#10;        Button(&#39;添加&#39;)&#10;          .onClick(() =&gt; {&#10;            if (this.inputText.trim()) {&#10;              this.todos.push({ id: Date.now(), text: this.inputText, done: false })&#10;              this.inputText = &#39;&#39;&#10;            }&#10;          })&#10;      }.width(&#39;100%&#39;).padding(16)&#10;&#10;      // 列表区域&#10;      List() {&#10;        ForEach(this.todos, (item: TodoItem) =&gt; {&#10;          ListItem() {&#10;            TodoItemView({ item: item })&#10;          }&#10;        })&#10;      }.layoutWeight(1)&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 鸿蒙 ArkTS 声明式 UI 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@Entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@Component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">struct TodoApp {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  @State </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">todos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Array</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TodoItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  @State </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">inputText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: string </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    Column</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 输入区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      Row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        TextInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ placeholder: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'输入待办事项...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inputText </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">layoutWeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'添加'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onClick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inputText.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.todos.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ id: Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), text: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inputText, done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.inputText </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 列表区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      List</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        ForEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.todos, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TodoItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          ListItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            TodoItemView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ item: item })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">layoutWeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>鸿蒙应用架构分层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[&quot;UI 层 (ArkUI)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;业务逻辑层&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;数据层&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;本地存储 (Preferences/RDB)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;网络请求 (@ohos/axios)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;系统能力 (相机/定位/通知)&quot;]\">graph TB\n    A[\"UI 层 (ArkUI)\"] --&gt; B[\"业务逻辑层\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"数据层\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"本地存储 (Preferences/RDB)\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"网络请求 (@ohos/axios)\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"系统能力 (相机/定位/通知)\"]</pre><p>ArkTS 的 <code>@State</code>、<code>@Prop</code>、<code>@Link</code> 装饰器管理组件间的数据流，类似 Vue 的响应式系统但更贴近 SwiftUI 的声明式风格。</p>\n<h3 id=\"鸿蒙分布式能力\">鸿蒙分布式能力</h3><p>HarmonyOS 的核心差异化能力是跨设备协同：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 跨设备数据同步（分布式数据库）&#10;import distributedData from &#39;@ohos.data.distributedData&#39;;&#10;&#10;const kvManager = distributedData.createKVManager({&#10;  bundleName: &#39;com.example.todo&#39;,&#10;  context: getContext(this),&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 数据自动在手机、平板、手表间同步&#10;await kvStore.put(&#39;todo_list&#39;, JSON.stringify(this.todos));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 跨设备数据同步（分布式数据库）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distributedData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ohos.data.distributedData'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> kvManager</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distributedData.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createKVManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bundleName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'com.example.todo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  context: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 数据自动在手机、平板、手表间同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kvStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'todo_list'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.todos));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一次开发即可适配手机、平板、智慧屏、手表等多种设备形态，这在 IoT 场景中具有显著优势。</p>\n<h3 id=\"react-native-概述\">React Native 概述</h3><p>React Native 使用 JavaScript/TypeScript 编写跨 iOS 和 Android 的移动应用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import React, { useState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;import { View, Text, FlatList, TextInput, TouchableOpacity } from &#39;react-native&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function TodoScreen() {&#10;  const [todos, setTodos] = useState([]);&#10;  const [input, setInput] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const addTodo = () =&gt; {&#10;    if (input.trim()) {&#10;      setTodos([...todos, { id: Date.now(), text: input }]);&#10;      setInput(&#39;&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;View style={{ flex: 1, padding: 20 }}&gt;&#10;      &lt;TextInput value={input} onChangeText={setInput} placeholder=&quot;新增待办&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;TouchableOpacity onPress={addTodo}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Text&gt;添加&lt;/Text&gt;&#10;      &lt;/TouchableOpacity&gt;&#10;      &lt;FlatList&#10;        data={todos}&#10;        keyExtractor={(item) =&gt; String(item.id)}&#10;        renderItem={({ item }) =&gt; &lt;Text&gt;{item.text}&lt;/Text&gt;}&#10;      /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/View&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import React, { useState } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { View, Text, FlatList, TextInput, TouchableOpacity } from 'react-native';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export default function TodoScreen() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [todos, setTodos] = useState([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [input, setInput] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const addTodo = () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (input.trim()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setTodos([...todos, { id: Date.now(), text: input }]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setInput('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;View style={{ flex: 1, padding: 20 }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;TextInput value={input} onChangeText={setInput} placeholder=\"新增待办\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;TouchableOpacity onPress={addTodo}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Text>添加&#x3C;/Text></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/TouchableOpacity></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;FlatList</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data={todos}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        keyExtractor={(item) => String(item.id)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        renderItem={({ item }) => &#x3C;Text>{item.text}&#x3C;/Text>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/View></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>React Native 新架构（Fabric 渲染器 + TurboModules）在 2026 年已成为默认选项，性能接近原生应用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"微信小程序开发\">微信小程序开发</h3><p>小程序运行在微信生态内，无需安装即可使用，适合轻量级场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// pages/index/index.js&#10;Page({&#10;  data: {&#10;    todos: [],&#10;    inputValue: &#39;&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;&#10;  onInput(e) {&#10;    this.setData({ inputValue: e.detail.value });&#10;  },&#10;&#10;  addTodo() {&#10;    const { todos, inputValue } = this.data;&#10;    if (!inputValue.trim()) return;&#10;    this.setData({&#10;      todos: [...todos, { id: Date.now(), text: inputValue, done: false }],&#10;      inputValue: &#39;&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pages/index/index.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  data: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    todos: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inputValue: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ inputValue: e.detail.value });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  addTodo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">todos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">inputValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputValue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      todos: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">todos, { id: Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), text: inputValue, done: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      inputValue: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>小程序框架（Taro、uni-app）可实现&quot;一套代码，多端运行&quot;（微信/支付宝/抖音小程序 + H5 + App）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨平台方案选型\">跨平台方案选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>生态成熟度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>鸿蒙 ArkTS</td>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td>鸿蒙全场景</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>快速增长中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React Native</td>\n<td>JS/TS</td>\n<td>iOS + Android</td>\n<td>接近原生</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flutter</td>\n<td>Dart</td>\n<td>iOS + Android + Web</td>\n<td>原生级</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小程序</td>\n<td>JS/TS</td>\n<td>超级 App 内嵌</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>uni-app/Taro</td>\n<td>Vue/React</td>\n<td>多端统一</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>国内成熟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型决策取决于目标平台、团队技术栈、性能要求和项目周期。2026 年国内市场鸿蒙份额持续攀升，掌握 ArkTS 已成为高职学生的就业优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>HarmonyOS NEXT 纯血鸿蒙</strong>：2025-2026 年间大量头部 App 完成鸿蒙原生开发，不再兼容 Android APK，ArkTS 开发岗位需求激增</li>\n<li><strong>AI 原生移动应用</strong>：大模型能力集成到移动端（端侧推理），如文本摘要、智能对话、图片识别直接在手机本地运行</li>\n<li><strong>Kotlin Multiplatform（KMP）</strong>：与 Swift 互操作性提升，成为 Android/iOS 共享业务逻辑的新选择</li>\n<li><strong>小程序向 AI 小程序演进</strong>：微信/抖音小程序接入 AI 能力 API，实现智能客服、语音交互等功能</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>使用鸿蒙 ArkTS 开发一个天气查询应用：调用公开天气 API，显示当前天气和未来三天预报，适配手机和平板两种屏幕尺寸。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较同一个待办事项功能在 ArkTS、React Native 和微信小程序中的实现差异。从开发效率、运行性能、用户体验三个维度进行对比分析。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>调研你所在城市 3-5 家互联网公司的移动开发岗位招聘要求，分析鸿蒙、Flutter、React Native 各自的市场需求占比，并据此制定个人学习优先级。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>移动应用开发在 2026 年呈现&quot;鸿蒙崛起、跨平台并存&quot;的格局。ArkTS 声明式 UI 和分布式能力代表了鸿蒙原生开发的方向，React Native 和小程序在各自生态中依然有广泛应用。全栈工程师需要理解不同方案的适用场景和技术权衡，能够根据项目需求选择最合适的移动端解决方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"移动应用开发","id":"移动应用开发"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"鸿蒙 ArkTS 开发","id":"鸿蒙-arkts-开发"},{"level":3,"text":"鸿蒙分布式能力","id":"鸿蒙分布式能力"},{"level":3,"text":"React Native 概述","id":"react-native-概述"},{"level":3,"text":"微信小程序开发","id":"微信小程序开发"},{"level":3,"text":"跨平台方案选型","id":"跨平台方案选型"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"后端 API 开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/backend-api-development"},"next":{"title":"软件测试","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/software-engineering/software-testing"}}